{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0064-minimum-path-sum","title":"LeetCode 64 最小路径和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0064-minimum-path-sum","wordCount":711,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-64-最小路径和\">LeetCode 64 最小路径和</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个包含非负整数的 m × n 网格 <code>grid</code>，请找出一条从左上角到右下角的路径，使得路径上的数字总和为最小。</p>\n<p>每次只能向下或者向右移动一步。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>m == grid.length</li>\n<li>n == grid[i].length</li>\n<li>1 ≤ m, n ≤ 200</li>\n<li>0 ≤ grid[i][j] ≤ 200</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：grid = [[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[4,2,1]] 输出：7 解释：路径 1 → 3 → 1 → 1 → 1 的总和最小，为 7。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：grid = [[1,2,3],[4,5,6]] 输出：12</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题与 LC #62（不同路径）的结构完全相同：机器人只能向右或向下移动，从左上到右下。区别在于 #62 求路径数量（累加），本题求路径最小和（取 min 后累加）。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义</strong>：<code>dp[i][j]</code> 表示从 <code>(0, 0)</code> 到 <code>(i, j)</code> 的最小路径和。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：<code>dp[i][j] = grid[i][j] + min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])</code></p>\n<p>到达 <code>(i, j)</code> 只能从上方或左方来，取两者中路径和较小的那个，再加上当前格子的值。</p>\n<p><strong>边界条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一行：<code>dp[0][j] = dp[0][j-1] + grid[0][j]</code>（只能从左边来）</li>\n<li>第一列：<code>dp[i][0] = dp[i-1][0] + grid[i][0]</code>（只能从上边来）</li>\n<li>起点：<code>dp[0][0] = grid[0][0]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力递归</td>\n<td>O(2^(m+n))</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>每个位置两种选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二维 DP</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>标准解法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一维 DP</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>空间优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原地修改</td>\n<td>O(m × n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>直接修改输入数组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>一维 DP（空间优化）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function minPathSum(grid: number[][]): number {&#10;  const m = grid.length;&#10;  const n = grid[0].length;&#10;  const dp = new Array(n).fill(0);&#10;&#10;  dp[0] = grid[0][0];&#10;  for (let j = 1; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;    dp[j] = dp[j - 1] + grid[0][j];&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; m; i++) {&#10;    dp[0] += grid[i][0];&#10;    for (let j = 1; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;      dp[j] = Math.min(dp[j], dp[j - 1]) + grid[i][j];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[n - 1];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> minPathSum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][j];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid[i][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(dp[j], dp[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid[i][j];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<p>首先初始化第一行：<code>dp[j]</code> 就是从 <code>(0, 0)</code> 到 <code>(0, j)</code> 的前缀和，因为第一行只能一路向右走。</p>\n<p>从第二行开始逐行更新：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[0] += grid[i][0]</code>：第一列只能从上方来，直接累加</li>\n<li><code>dp[j] = min(dp[j], dp[j-1]) + grid[i][j]</code>：<ul>\n<li><code>dp[j]</code>（更新前）= 从上方来的路径和（即 <code>dp[i-1][j]</code>）</li>\n<li><code>dp[j-1]</code>（更新后）= 从左方来的路径和（即 <code>dp[i][j-1]</code>）</li>\n<li>取较小值再加上当前格子的值</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>原地修改解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function minPathSumInPlace(grid: number[][]): number {&#10;  const m = grid.length;&#10;  const n = grid[0].length;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; m; i++) grid[i][0] += grid[i - 1][0];&#10;  for (let j = 1; j &lt; n; j++) grid[0][j] += grid[0][j - 1];&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; m; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 1; j &lt; n; j++) {&#10;      grid[i][j] += Math.min(grid[i - 1][j], grid[i][j - 1]);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return grid[m - 1][n - 1];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> minPathSumInPlace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">grid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"co